segment.source:
::She yawns.:: You better do it fast, zoner. Or else I'm gonna fall... ::She snores loudly and then twitches.:: 
Wha-- Wha--

::She puts on her dull look again, waiting for you to do something entertaining.::&lt;end&gt;

